# Prompt: Portfolio Landing Page — Minh (Robotics Engineer & Builder)

Build a personal portfolio landing page for **"Minh"** using **React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, and Lucide React**. Dark theme (`#0C0C0C` background), font **Kanit** (Google Fonts, weights 300–900). Page title: **"Minh — Builder & Engineer"**.

---

## GLOBAL STYLES
- Background `#0C0C0C` on `html`, `body`, `#root`, and the main wrapper
- Font family: `'Kanit', sans-serif`
- Global reset: `box-sizing: border-box`, margin 0, padding 0
- CSS class `.hero-heading`: gradient text using `background: linear-gradient(180deg, #646973 0%, #BBCCD7 100%)` with `-webkit-background-clip: text` and `-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent`
- Main wrapper has `overflowX: 'clip'`

## SECTION ORDER
1. HeroSection
2. MarqueeSection
3. AboutSection
4. JourneySection
5. ProjectsSection
6. AchievementsSection
7. PersonalCornerSection

## IMAGE FOLDER STRUCTURE
All images are local — read from these folders (no external URLs):

```
/public/images/
  hero/                     (portrait / hero photo)
  marquee/gart/             (Mock GART, FTC Thanh Hoa, FTC National, FTC Worlds, GART Expo)
  marquee/envirotrack/      (EnviroTrack devices, deployment photos)
  marquee/conrad/           (Conrad Challenge AUV photos)
  about/                    (4 decorative corner images: gear/robot icon, circuit icon, plane icon, music note icon)
  journey/gart/
  journey/envirotrack/
  journey/conrad/
  journey/samsung/
  journey/ins/
  journey/research/
  journey/stembridge/
  journey/volunteer/
  projects/gart/
  projects/envirotrack/
  projects/conrad/
  achievements/
  personal/aviation/
  personal/music/
```

---

## 1. HERO SECTION
Full viewport height (`h-screen`), flex column layout, `overflowX: clip`.

**Navbar**: Horizontal nav bar with 4 links — "About", "Journey", "Projects", "Contact" — evenly spaced with `justify-between`. Text color `#D7E2EA`, `font-medium`, uppercase, tracking-wider. Sizes: `text-sm md:text-lg lg:text-[1.4rem]`. Padding: `px-6 md:px-10 pt-6 md:pt-8`. Hover: opacity 70% with 200ms transition.

**Hero Heading**: Massive `h1` with text `"Hi, i'm Minh"` (lowercase "i", curly apostrophe via `&apos;`). Uses the `.hero-heading` gradient text class. `font-black`, uppercase, tracking-tight, leading-none, whitespace-nowrap, `w-full`. Font sizes: `text-[14vw] sm:text-[15vw] md:text-[16vw] lg:text-[17.5vw]`. Margin top: `mt-6 sm:mt-4 md:-mt-5`. Wrapped in `overflow-hidden` container.

**Bottom bar**: Flexbox `justify-between items-end` with `pb-7 sm:pb-8 md:pb-10`:
- **Left**: paragraph text `"an engineer driven by curiosity — from robots to research"`, color `#D7E2EA`, font-light, uppercase, tracking-wide, leading-snug. Font size: `clamp(0.75rem, 1.4vw, 1.5rem)`. Max-width: `max-w-[160px] sm:max-w-[220px] md:max-w-[260px]`.
- **Right**: `ContactButton` component (see below)

**Hero Portrait**: Centered absolutely. Uses a `Magnet` component (mouse-following magnetic effect) wrapping an image from `hero/portrait.png`. Magnet settings: padding 150, strength 3, activeTransition `"transform 0.3s ease-out"`, inactiveTransition `"transform 0.6s ease-in-out"`. Positioning: `absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10`. Width: `w-[280px] sm:w-[360px] md:w-[440px] lg:w-[520px]`. On mobile: `top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2`. On sm+: `sm:top-auto sm:translate-y-0 sm:bottom-0`.

**FadeIn animations**: Navbar delay 0, y -20. Heading: delay 0.15, y 40. Left text: delay 0.35, y 20. Contact button: delay 0.5, y 20. Portrait: delay 0.6, y 30.

---

## 2. MARQUEE SECTION
Two rows of images that scroll horizontally based on page scroll position. Background `#0C0C0C`. Padding: `pt-24 sm:pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-10`.

**Source images**: read all images from `marquee/gart/`, `marquee/envirotrack/`, and `marquee/conrad/` (real photos: Mock GART robots, FTC Thanh Hoa Scrimmage, FTC National, FTC Worlds, GART Expo, EnviroTrack deployed devices, Conrad Challenge AUV prototype). Split them roughly in half into two rows.

- Row 1: first half of images, tripled for seamless scrolling. Moves **RIGHT** on scroll (`translateX(offset - 200)`).
- Row 2: remaining images, tripled. Moves **LEFT** on scroll (`translateX(-(offset - 200))`).
- Scroll offset: `(window.scrollY - sectionTop + window.innerHeight) * 0.3`
- Each image tile: `420px x 270px`, `rounded-2xl`, `object-cover`, lazy loaded.
- Gap between tiles: `gap-3`. Gap between rows: `gap-3`.
- `willChange: 'transform'` for performance. Scroll listener is passive.

---

## 3. ABOUT SECTION
Full-height centered section, `min-h-screen`, padding `px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-20`.

Four decorative images positioned absolutely in corners, sourced from `about/` (suggested icons: gear/robot icon, circuit-board icon, airplane icon, music-note icon):

- **Top-left**: `about/gear-icon.png`, `w-[120px] sm:w-[160px] md:w-[210px]`, positioned `top-[4%] left-[1%] sm:left-[2%] md:left-[4%]`. FadeIn: delay 0.1, x -80, y 0, duration 0.9.
- **Bottom-left**: `about/circuit-icon.png`, `w-[100px] sm:w-[140px] md:w-[180px]`, positioned `bottom-[8%] left-[3%] sm:left-[6%] md:left-[10%]`. FadeIn: delay 0.25, x -80, y 0, duration 0.9.
- **Top-right**: `about/plane-icon.png`, `w-[120px] sm:w-[160px] md:w-[210px]`, positioned `top-[4%] right-[1%] sm:right-[2%] md:right-[4%]`. FadeIn: delay 0.15, x 80, y 0, duration 0.9.
- **Bottom-right**: `about/music-icon.png`, `w-[130px] sm:w-[170px] md:w-[220px]`, positioned `bottom-[8%] right-[3%] sm:right-[6%] md:right-[10%]`. FadeIn: delay 0.3, x 80, y 0, duration 0.9.

**Heading**: `"About me"` using `.hero-heading` gradient text, `font-black`, uppercase, leading-none, tracking-tight, centered. Font size: `clamp(3rem, 12vw, 160px)`. FadeIn: delay 0, y 40.

**Animated paragraph** (character-by-character scroll-driven opacity, using `AnimatedText`): color `#D7E2EA`, font-medium, centered, leading-relaxed, `max-w-[560px]`, font size `clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem)`. Scroll offset `['start 0.8', 'end 0.2']`. Text content:

> "Starting with robots, I discovered I could turn ideas into reality. From FIRST Tech Challenge competitions to environmental sensors and underwater vehicles, I keep chasing problems that let me build, measure, and learn something new."

Contact button below the text block. Gap between heading/text: `gap-10 sm:gap-14 md:gap-16`. Gap between text block and button: `gap-16 sm:gap-20 md:gap-24`.

---

## 4. JOURNEY SECTION *(replaces ServicesSection)*
White background (`#FFFFFF`), rounded top corners `rounded-t-[40px] sm:rounded-t-[50px] md:rounded-t-[60px]`. Padding: `px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-20 sm:py-24 md:py-32`.

**Heading**: `"Journey"` in `#0C0C0C`, font-black, uppercase, centered, font size `clamp(3rem, 12vw, 160px)`. Margin bottom: `mb-16 sm:mb-20 md:mb-28`.

4 items in a vertical list, `max-w-5xl`, centered:

**01 — Robotics (GART)**
"Led mechanics teams from Mock GART to FIRST Tech Challenge — national champion with a 16-match winning streak, Design Award winner, World Championship Finalist Alliance runner-up, while training and mentoring a 40-member department."

**02 — Environmental Devices**
"Built EnviroTrack, an air-quality monitoring system with 25+ units deployed across Hanoi and Nam Định, and led electricals and CAD design on an autonomous underwater vehicle mapping microplastic pollution for the Conrad Challenge, reaching the Global Innovation Challenge at Johnson Space Center."

**03 — Research & Deep Dive**
"Strengthened Java and DSA foundations at Samsung R&D Vietnam, interned in power grid systems at INS Engineering, and researched NDO-MPC control methods for power distribution systems, presenting the work at the GTSD conference."

**04 — STEM Outreach (STEMbridge)**
"Founded STEMbridge to bring STEM fairs, makerspace donations, and hands-on workshops to underserved schools — from Quan Sơn Boarding School in Lạng Sơn to Xa Đàn School for Deaf Students."

Each item: horizontal layout — number (`font-black`, font size `clamp(3rem, 10vw, 140px)`, color `#0C0C0C`) on the left, name + description stacked on the right. Name: `font-medium`, uppercase, font size `clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 2.1rem)`. Description: `font-light`, leading-relaxed, `max-w-2xl`, font size `clamp(0.85rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem)`, opacity 0.6. Items separated by 1px borders (`rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.15)`). Padding: `py-8 sm:py-10 md:py-12`. Staggered FadeIn: each item delays by `i * 0.1`.

---

## 5. PROJECTS SECTION
Dark background (`#0C0C0C`), rounded top corners, pulled up with `-mt-10 sm:-mt-12 md:-mt-14`, `z-10`.

**Heading**: `"Project"` (singular) using `.hero-heading` gradient, same styling as other headings.

3 sticky-stacking project cards that scale down as you scroll past them (card stacking effect using Framer Motion `useScroll` and `useTransform`). Each card is `sticky top-24 md:top-32` inside an `h-[85vh]` container.

Scale calculation: `targetScale = 1 - (totalCards - 1 - index) * 0.03`. Each card offset by `top: ${index * 28}px`.

Each card: `rounded-[40px] sm:rounded-[50px] md:rounded-[60px]`, `border-2 border-[#D7E2EA]`, background `#0C0C0C`, padding `p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8`.

**Card layout**:
- Top row: Number (huge, same style as journey numbers), category label, project name, and a "Live Project" ghost button (`LiveProjectButton`) — relabel to **"Read More"**.
- Bottom row: Two-column image grid — left column (40% width) has 2 stacked images, right column (60%) has 1 tall image. All images `rounded-[40px] sm:rounded-[50px] md:rounded-[60px]`. Left top image height: `clamp(130px, 16vw, 230px)`. Left bottom image height: `clamp(160px, 22vw, 340px)`.

**Project data** (local image paths):

**Project 01 — "GART / FIRST Tech Challenge"** (Team — Head of Mechanics & CAD)
- Col1 image 1: `projects/gart/robot-01.jpg`
- Col1 image 2: `projects/gart/thanh-hoa-scrimmage.jpg`
- Col2 image: `projects/gart/national-champion.jpg`

**Project 02 — "EnviroTrack"** (Team lead, 3 members)
- Col1 image 1: `projects/envirotrack/device-01.jpg`
- Col1 image 2: `projects/envirotrack/poster.jpg`
- Col2 image: `projects/envirotrack/deployment.jpg`

**Project 03 — "Conrad Challenge — Autonomous Underwater Vehicle"**
- Col1 image 1: `projects/conrad/cad-design.jpg`
- Col1 image 2: `projects/conrad/electricals.jpg`
- Col2 image: `projects/conrad/prototype.jpg`

---

## 6. ACHIEVEMENTS SECTION *(new)*
Dark background continues from Projects (or white — designer's choice for contrast). Simple grid of certificate/award images from `achievements/`. Heading `"Achievements"` styled consistently with other section headings (`.hero-heading` gradient or plain, `font-black`, uppercase, centered). No complex animation needed beyond a simple staggered FadeIn per grid item.

