## 7. PERSONAL CORNER SECTION *(new, closing section)*
Lighter, more personal tone. Two columns side by side (stack on mobile):

**Aviation** — images from `personal/aviation/`. Text:
> "I'm drawn to planes and the history of aviation. I collect 1:400 model planes and read extensively about Vietnamese aviation history. I built a budget home cockpit — a DIY A320 — using wood plates, 3D-printed parts, and electronics, and now run HomeA320, renting it out by the hour to fund my other projects."

**Music** — images/videos from `personal/music/`. Text:
> "I'm a fan of American rock music from the 60s through the early 90s, especially anti-war and counterculture songs. I play electric guitar and occasionally perform near Văn Miếu Coffee on summer weekends. Favorite songs: 'More Than a Feeling' and 'It's My Life'."

Heading style consistent with other sections but can use a smaller font size (`clamp(2rem, 6vw, 80px)`) since this is a closing/footer-like section.

